  {
   "title": "첫 부분적분",
   "text": "$$\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{x^{2}\\cos x}{(1+\\sin x)^{2}}dx=\\left[-\\frac{x^{2}}{1+\\sin x}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}+2 \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{x}{1+\\sin x}dx=-\\frac{\\pi^{2}}{8}+2 \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{x}{1+\\sin x}dx$$",
