   "uses": [
    "C1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "둘째",
   "text": "$$\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{x}{1+\\sin x}dx=\\left[-\\frac{x \\cos x}{1+\\sin x}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}+\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\cos x}{1+\\sin x}dx=0+\\left[\\ln(1+\\sin x)\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\ln 2$$",
   "uses": [
    "C1"
   ]
